    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 1995-kondo-pomacanthus-stripe-insertion.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Pomacanthus semicirculatus & Pomacanthus imperator (marine angelfish) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 54.4/100, audit 2026-10-19-pomacanthus-stripe-insertion-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/1995-kondo-pomacanthus-stripe-insertion.py> ;
    schema:about "Pomacanthus semicirculatus & Pomacanthus imperator (marine angelfish)" ;
